These restrictions apply even if the price is charged indirectly or the
Software has been renamed, repackaged, or modified. They do not prohibit
the creative services and internal business use expressly allowed in
Section 3. An optional donation is allowed only when payment is not required
for, and does not obtain, a copy, feature, or access unavailable without it.

